```text
governing contract and version
expected obligation
observed counterexample or suspected violation
relevant execution / state / environment commitments
affected capability and dependency slice
evidence strength and uncertainty
authority permitted to resolve it
```

A user might say, “You acknowledged my upload, but it vanished after reboot.”
