| Question | Required evidence |
|---|---|
| What obligation does this address? | Contract identifier and divergence witness |
| Is behavior preserved or deliberately changed? | Equivalence/refinement evidence, or an authorized contract revision |
| What else can this affect? | Dependency impact and compositional obligations |
| Does deployed state remain valid? | Migration relation, recovery protocol, and rollback limits |
| What new authority does it need? | Explicit capability delta |
