The institution needs roles and durable procedures, not just a capable agent.

| Role | Authority |
|---|---|
| Intent owner | Approves intended behavior and acceptable tradeoffs |
| Contract steward | Maintains specifications, observation boundaries, and assumption regimes |
| Proposer: Klanker or external contributor | Produces candidate changes and evidence |
| Independent verifier | Checks evidence under pinned rules |
| Admission controller | Applies capability, resource, and release policy |
| Operational supervisor | Enforces boundaries and records violations |
| Incident authority | Revokes, quarantines, or authorizes emergency intervention |

These are logical roles; one person may initially hold several. But their permissions should remain distinguishable.
